#, c-format
msgid "Its programs kept starting each other: %d hand-offs in a row."
msgstr ""
"Spillets programmer fortsatte å starte hverandre: %d overleveringer på rad."

#: title/pc5_library.c:1057
msgid "The program's path is too long for Windows."
msgstr "Programmets bane er for lang for Windows."

